9-
10:- REVIEW: `TASK-260720-3c0ss2` cycle 3 requests implementation rework. Replacing cached Windows `DirEntry.stat()` identity with no-follow `os.lstat()` is correct, but the named-stream boundary is incomplete.
11:- ROOT MUTATION: `_validated_root_stat` enumerates root streams only during initial freeze. `FrozenSnapshot.recheck()` uses raw root `lstat` plus a descendant scan, so a persistent ADS added to the snapshot root during the consumer callback survives the last-child recheck. The independent seam recorded root checks `('.', 'file', '.')` during freeze, only `('file',)` during recheck, and `root_stream_mutation_failed_closed=False`.
