14:- REWORK: the root is now enumerated before every descendant re-scan, so persistent root and descendant ADS additions during `FrozenSnapshot.use()` fail as `SnapshotMutationError`. `FindClose` failure captures `GetLastError` immediately; when enumeration also fails, the enumeration `OSError` stays primary and the cleanup `OSError` is its explicit cause. Platform-independent first/next/close seams and native root/descendant ADS tests cover the boundary. Final local gates: source 28 passed / 4 Windows skips, accepted-root focused 207 passed / 4 skips, strict mypy 58 files, full 716 passed / 5 skips, build/package/compile/diff checks green. Native Windows CI remains sequenced after review-authorized publication.
